, and portable; refrigeration compressor industrial; railway; aerospace; marine; locomotive; off road and on road motorcycle, cart, and jet ski; racing; earth-moving equipment; gensets; wind energy; and e-mobility industries. Balu Forge Industries Limited is based in Mumbai, India.","employees":179,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1789689600,"asOf":1795839551},"analyst":null,"cap":"Micro","caFix":null,"fetched":1795839550,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Balu Forge Industries\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Capital expenditures of Balu Forge Industries Ltd – NSE:BALUFORGE","s":"TradingView","d":1795777403,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQX2ZlVk8wQzNJeFNmQzNsTmtOZVg2LXpySWVGUjI4MkszdURDTFJFdHdiOHFhekdhUlpneEdaajdieUQxZk5LUWE3NDdESU5HUjdmdkw5Zm13VDZHTzJaUW9XbEZMaE1BUkc2RnB2My1VLV9Nd2JCdjNXQ0ZUSlhUc2ZPREdodzhyazZmRXFkRzMzcjdLUndr?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Balu Forge Industries Gets NSE, BSE In-Principle Nod for FCCB Issue","s":"Kalkine India","d":1795693860,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Balu Forge Industries secures in-principle FCCB issuance approval","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795675631,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNdWgwNVlyT291dktYbzd5WlVKS1BvOVU1RmgtV1QxVk50VjMwVjVnSGtDX1FLZjN0eXY5Y3pLbzl5cmNNeUxxNTBNVWE3MF9VVXVHVEthQWdZd0YzRUExZ01FUENzdmltYmZpMFl0ZmtkTjNCNmJwU1JtV2tmZVdyVTdkNXNsRXBtNVhxYkdWT2NLdjU1OS1BTTNlMnUyUG5aYkJDMHlsMlRybU5sb0NkTjVVeUQ4UEh5T2RV?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Balu Forge Industries Secures NSE, BSE FCCB Approval","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1795673530,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQY1JNdUhHUG9LVWdfeS1fY2E2azZkbFlUSDdIZGZESWhoYzNuU0MteHR5THVfdmRPcnlZYlhFc0F0d1lncXJ0bjNTU20yRzZyY2I5LVBic3Y4OTdRd2YwTG1mdzZjLUFZVGZiakVzbXFrZm01OE9UYXBEaWgwQ0NlQ25qOVAxNVRGelBZcUhydXpYLXNqc0dGMUZLWE1wdw?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Balu Forge promoter acquires 65,000 shares via open market","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795608407,"u":"https://news.